    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "a controlled break? i dont even know what that means. everything feels so heavy. it feels like i'm just waiting for something to happen, but nothing ever does. i'm just stuck in this loop of existing, and it doesn't even feel like living anymore. it just feels like i'm taking up space in a room that's getting smaller every day.",
